      "content": "thanks. i was thinking about just using some superglue to seal the hole shut so no more dirt gets in while i'm walking around. would that be okay to do? also, do i really need to see a doctor if it doesn't look red or swollen yet? it's pretty deep so i just want to make sure it's airtight.",
